'''Bears''' are a race of carnivoran mammals found throughout [[Gielinor]], typically in forests.

==Callisto==
[[File:Callisto.png|250px|right]]
[[Callisto]] is a powerful bear [[boss]] found in [[Callisto's Den|its den]] in the [[Wilderness]]. A scaled-down, solo-able version of Callisto, [[Artio]] can be found in [[Hunter's End]]. The bear bosses' notable drops include: [[dragon pickaxe]], [[tyrannical ring]], and the [[Callisto cub]] pet.

